## Commits
### 36be18e
docs(core): describe array method interception on both kinds of state

The root and source folder agent docs still described the seven mutating
array methods as merely intercepted. Since the hookless get handler now
routes them through the same wrapper as the hooked one, both documents
state that the methods are intercepted on state with and without hooks,
run through the Proxy inside a batch, wake each subscriber at most once
per call, are subject to the loop check inside an effect, and are seen
by the read and write hooks.


